{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romcab Puzzle</strong> is a single-player puzzle experience that blends logic, relaxation, and visual aesthetics. The game features <strong>100 cube-based levels</strong>, each designed to encourage strategic thinking and offer moments of calm and enjoyment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can tackle challenges at their own pace, accompanied by their favorite music, while exploring a wide variety of artistic styles that keep each level feeling fresh and distinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romcab is designed for both casual players and puzzle enthusiasts, with a progressive difficulty curve that ensures accessibility and challenge. There\u2019s no pressure\u2014just the joy of solving and advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 100 cube-based puzzle levels that stimulate logic and creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Diverse visual styles that bring freshness and personality to each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Play with your own music for a personalized experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Single-player gameplay with no competitive elements or in-app purchases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Suitable for all ages: accessible, relaxing, and mentally engaging</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romcab Puzzle is where logic meets good vibes. Get ready to unwind, think, and enjoy.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First puzzle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094400/56e84b1329cc6f5049a433a9f096f83a184ded8b.jpg"},{"name":"Animal puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094400/56e84b1329cc6f5049a433a9f096f83a184ded8b.jpg"},{"name":"Sport puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit